    "## Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "### Key Takeaways:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **LSTM = RNN + Memory Control**\n",
    "   - Adds cell state as long-term memory\n",
    "   - Uses gates to control information flow\n",
    "\n",
    "2. **Three Gates:**\n",
    "   - **Forget Gate:** What to discard from memory\n",
    "   - **Input Gate:** What new info to add\n",
    "   - **Output Gate:** What to output\n",
    "\n",
    "3. **Solves RNN Problems:**\n",
    "   - Vanishing gradient → Addition in cell state\n",
    "   - Long-term dependencies → Memory conveyor belt\n",
    "   - Information overwriting → Gating mechanisms\n",
    "\n",
    "4. **Why It Works:**\n",
    "   - Cell state uses addition (gradient = 1)\n",
    "   - Gates use sigmoid (0-1 range)\n",
    "   - Can selectively remember/forget\n",
    "\n",
    "5. **Evolution:**\n",
    "   - RNN → LSTM → GRU → Transformers\n",
    "```"
